WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:03.975
The Budget Betrayal.

00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:10.525
The federal share of provincial health spending has declined from 50 percent to roughly 22 percent.

00:00:10.525 --> 00:00:13.837
Every Prime Minister has failed to restore it.

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:16.725
The PBO's own numbers prove it.
